Package: TableCleaneR
Type: Package
Title: Collapse Duplicate Key Groups in Tibbles with Safe Concatenation
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Benoît", "Simon-Bouhet", email = "bsimonbo@univ-lr.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to enforce uniqueness of key combinations in tabular data by
    collapsing duplicate rows. For each key group, selected columns can be
    concatenated to preserve information, while other divergent fields are
    replaced by typed missing values to avoid silent conflicts. Companion
    helpers return candidate rows and subsets of collapsed results to support
    auditing and quality control workflows in tidyverse pipelines.
